  "title": "Never bet on being a Boltzmann brain",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "c01701fd-7e85-4585-96f4-b5ff5e02a842",
      "text": "An agent should never bet on being a Boltzmann brain, however many Boltzmann brains a cosmological model contains. Counting copies is the wrong method, and the agent will probably experience ordinary planetary life next.",
